# Migration report

`terradart-migrate {{version}}` migrated `../terradart_coverage/test/fixtures/real_plan_src` into the Dart package `real_plan_src`: 2 module directories, 11 blocks became Dart, 2 stay in Terraform (listed below, each with its reason).

## Next steps

1. `dart pub get`
2. `dart run bin/infra.dart` — writes `main.tf.json` next to the sidecar files in every Terraform directory under `tf-out/`.
3. In `tf-out`: `terraform init && terraform plan` — expect *No changes* against the existing state.

