  | `google_storage_bucket_object.config` | argument "content" is sensitive: its value is not copied into Dart (pass it as a variable) | `terradart_leftover.tf` |
  | `module.network` | module calls stay in Terraform until ModuleCall (#665) | `terradart_leftover.tf` |

### `modules/network`

- Role: child, called from `.`
- Stack: `NetworkStack` in `lib/network_stack.dart`; packages: `terradart_google`; providers: `google`
